15
00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.815
Now, I'll load in the environment

16
00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:51.217
variables and set the host and port.

17
00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.421
Then I'll create an A2AAgent object

18
00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.423
and call it HealthcareProviderAgent,

19
00:00:56.623 --> 00:01:00.026
passing in the URL with the host and port.

20
00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.964
Now, I'll give this agent the same prompt from earlier.

21
00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.034
I'll call the agent with the

22
00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:10.370
run method and print out the response.

23
00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.139
Excellent. We have a similar response to before.

24
00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.943
So now this agent acts as a full-featured agent framework agent.

25
00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.145
So that means you can use it in

26
00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.947
